{
  "format": "xp/1",
  "id": "ladder-run",
  "name": "Ladder Run",
  "blurb": "A race up a ladder of platforms. Four legs, each a different colour, each asking one more thing than the last: walk the stairs, jump the gaps, sprint the wide ones, then the gate. Miss a jump and you are back at the start — there is nothing under the course to land on, which is what makes it a platformer rather than a stroll.",
